#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/includes/branch_explainer.html
msgid "What does &ldquo;Permanent (Plantilla)&rdquo; mean?"
msgstr "Ano ang ibig sabihin ng &ldquo;Permanent (Plantilla)&rdquo;?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/includes/branch_explainer.html
msgid "What does &ldquo;Contract of Service&rdquo; mean?"
msgstr "Ano ang ibig sabihin ng &ldquo;Contract of Service&rdquo;?"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/includes/branch_explainer.html
msgid "This is a <strong>regular government post</strong> with full Civil Service tenure and full government benefits. It follows the standard Civil Service Commission appointment process and is funded by a regular plantilla item."
msgstr "Ito ay <strong>regular na trabaho sa gobyerno</strong> na may Civil Service tenure at kumpletong government benefits. Dumadaan ito sa normal na appointment process ng Civil Service Commission at may regular na plantilla item."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/includes/branch_explainer.html
msgid "Not looking for a permanent post? <strong>Contract of Service</strong> openings are time-bound engagements for specific work or projects."
msgstr "Hindi naghahanap ng permanent? Ang <strong>Contract of Service</strong> openings ay may takdang panahon at para sa specific na trabaho o project."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/includes/branch_explainer.html
msgid "This is a <strong>time-bound engagement</strong> for specific work or projects. It does not carry tenure or Civil Service eligibility, and the benefits package differs from a permanent appointment."
msgstr "Ito ay <strong>trabahong may takdang panahon</strong> para sa specific na trabaho o project. Wala itong tenure o Civil Service eligibility, at iba ang benefits kumpara sa permanent na appointment."

