msgstr "Naghahanap ng permanent? Ang <strong>Plantilla</strong> openings ay regular na trabaho sa gobyerno na may Civil Service tenure at kumpletong government benefits."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/includes/branch_explainer.html
msgid "You are applying for a <strong>Permanent (Plantilla)</strong> position &mdash; a regular government post with Civil Service tenure and full government benefits."
msgstr "Nag-a-apply ka para sa <strong>Permanent (Plantilla)</strong> na position &mdash; regular na trabaho sa gobyerno na may Civil Service tenure at kumpletong government benefits."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/includes/branch_explainer.html
msgid "You are applying for a <strong>Contract of Service</strong> position &mdash; a time-bound engagement for specific work or projects, without Civil Service tenure."
msgstr "Nag-a-apply ka para sa <strong>Contract of Service</strong> na position &mdash; trabahong may takdang panahon para sa specific na trabaho o project, walang Civil Service tenure."

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/includes/branch_explainer.html recruitment/templates/recruitment/includes/job_card.html
msgid "Permanent"
msgstr "Permanent"

#: recruitment/templates/recruitment/includes/branch_explainer.html
